{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54304","headline":"四祖双峯松 · 克符道者","name":"四祖双峯松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠合鸡山树，峩峩祖岫松。\n凝霜分五叶，含雪振双峯。\n月迥金河内，珠添玉镜中。\n飕飀传细离，天下播真宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}